actual main / PR head / tested commit+tree / machine deployment；来源；现有A/U；已实现与净缺口；修改清单；每条命令exit code＋semantic verdict；receipt/artifact引用及digest；剩余必须/待权限/环境/未来分栏。未拿到证据不得写DONE；SKIPPED_HEADLESS不得写WINDOWS_TAURI_E2E PASS。

